        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Arledge, John Ford, Louise Latimer, Moroni Olsen\n- Products: The Grapes of Wrath, Two in Revolt\n- Companies: RKO Radio Pictures\n- Topics: American film and stage acting, supporting roles in 1930s–1940s Hollywood films\n\nFacts:\n- John Arledge was born on March 12, 1906, and he was an American film and stage actor.\n- Two in Revolt was released by RKO Radio Pictures on April 3, 1936.\n- Two in Revolt starred John Arledge, Louise Latimer, and Moroni Olsen, and it featured Lightning the dog and Warrior the horse.\n- The Grapes of Wrath is a 1940 drama film directed by John Ford.\n- John Arledge played dozens of supporting roles in Hollywood films of the 1930s and 1940s, including a role in The Grapes of Wrath.\n- John Arledge died on May 15, 1947.",
